{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#card-zh","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tool Activator 是 DSH Web 客户端的工具管理插件：默认提供基础工具，其余已安装工具可由模型通过 activate_tools 按需启用，减少提示中的工具上下文。它把当前 agent 可用工具整理成目录，显示未启用项的名称和简介；启用后提供完整 schema 与使用说明。用户可在配置面板调整默认工具、审批选项和工具分组，也可按 MCP server 聚合工具。适合需要控制工具上下文并按任务加载工具的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:12-30","src/catalog.ts:7-62","src/prompt.ts:13-60","src/config.ts:8-20"]}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#card-en","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Tool Activator manages tools in the DSH web client. It loads basic tools by default and lets the model activate others on demand. The catalog shows inactive tool names and summaries; activation provides full schemas. Users can configure defaults, approval, and custom or MCP server groups.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:12-30","src/catalog.ts:7-62","src/prompt.ts:13-60","src/config.ts:8-20"]}
