{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#feature-1","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tool Activator 的功能「按需启用工具」：将未启用工具以标识和简介列入提示目录。模型调用 activate_tools 并提供标识与理由后，可加载相应工具的完整 schema 和用法说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:7-21","src/prompt.ts:13-23","src/runtime.ts:9-45"]}
