{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-2","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · DSH Tool Activator：[![npm version][npm-version-src]][npm-version-href]\n[![npm downloads][npm-downloads-src]][npm-downloads-href]\n[![bundle][bundle-src]][bundle-href]\n[![JSDocs][jsdocs-src]][jsdocs-href]\n[![License][license-src]][license-href]\n\n为 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 减少初始工具上下文：默认仅展示基础工具，其余工具通过 `activate_tools` 按需加载。\n</div>\n\n* **系统要求**：DSH $\\ge$ `0.2.0-rc.2`；Node.js $\\ge$ `22.19.0`。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"DSH Tool Activator"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-3","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 核心行为：默认基础工具为 `read`、`glob`、`grep`、`write`、`edit`、`skill`、`ask_user_question`、`todo_write`，均可取消默认加载；只有 `activate_tools` 始终加载且不可关闭。\n\n模型每次都看到：配置为默认加载的工具、已激活工具、`activate_tools`，以及其余工具的 `<available_tools>` 简述目录。","source":"extracted","section":"核心行为"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-4","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 默认启用的工具：`read`、`glob`、`grep`、`write`、`edit`、`skill`、`ask_user_question`、`todo_write`","source":"extracted","section":"默认启用的工具"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-5","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具：| 分类 | 工具标识 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 文件写入 | `write`、`edit` |\n| 命令执行 | `bash`、`pwsh` |\n| 联网 | `web_search`、`web_fetch` |\n| 后台任务 | `job_output`、`job_list`、`job_kill` |\n| 终端 | `terminal_open`、`terminal_send`、`terminal_read`、`terminal_signal`、`terminal_close`、`terminal_list` |\n| 目标 | `get_goal`、`create_goal`、`update_goal` |\n| 会话检索 | `session_search`、`session_event_search`、`session_trace`、`session_event_trace`、`session_event_read` |\n| 代码智能 | `lsp` |\n| 编排 | `subagent`、`subagent_fork`、`workflow`、`ralph`、`structured_output` |","source":"extracted","section":"可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-6","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具：此外，任意已安装插件的工具都可作为标识请求；开启 `autoGroupMcp` 时，`mcp__server__tool` 还会按 server 聚合为 `mcp.server`。\n\n实际可用集合将以 `<available_tools>` 目录呈现，该目录随提示词注入给模型，只有标识、名称和一句简述：\n\n```xml\n<available_tools description=\"These tools are installed but not yet enabled. Use activate_tools to enable them when needed.\">\n  <tool identifier=\"web_search\" name=\"web_search\">Search the public web for current information.</tool>\n  <tool identifier=\"mcp.mail\" name=\"mail\">send: Send a message through the mailbox.</tool>\n</available_tools>","source":"extracted","section":"可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-7","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具：模型可按需请求加载工具或组：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"identifiers\": [\"web_search\", \"web_fetch\"],\n  \"reason\": \"需要检索并核对用户要求的公开资料\"\n}","source":"extracted","section":"可通过 `activate_tools` 加载的工具"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-8","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 激活不重写请求头：路由声明支持对话中途变更工具时（`deepseek-flash` 等，见模型目录的 `toolUpdate`），插件把**全部**工具一次性声明出去：基础工具正常声明，其余标 `defer_loading`（不占上下文 token）。激活因此不改动声明列表，只在会话尾部追加一条 `tool_addition`，提供方此前缓存的前缀保持有效。\n\n不支持该能力的路由退回\"按激活状态过滤声明列表\"，功能不变，但每次新激活会重算一次请求头。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"激活不重写请求头"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-9","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 配置：进入官方插件管理页，打开 `dsh-tool-activator` 卡片，配置表单直接显示在该插件的页面上。\n\n<img width=\"2075\" height=\"1248\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25214d03-2743-4ba1-8064-675e43de0ea6\" />\n\n表单显示工具列表：\n\n| 分区 | 含义 |\n| --- | --- |\n| **默认激活** | 每次请求都带完整 schema 的工具；基础工具排在最前并带\"基础工具\"标记，但允许关闭；仅 `activate_tools` 的开关固定开启且不可关闭 |\n| **按需激活** | 其余工具，模型可使用 `activate_tools` 按需获取 |\n\n打开某一项的开关即把它写进 `basicTools`（默认加载），关闭则移回按需区；工具清单与描述由宿主 Remote `toolActivator/catalog` 提供，覆盖当前所有 live agent 作用域。","source":"extracted","section":"配置"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-10","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 配置：**常规**区两个开关：`requireApproval`（非完全权限时激活前请求确认，缺少审批服务时直接拒绝；完全权限 `danger-full-access` 时无需确认，即使审批策略为 `never`）与 `autoGroupMcp`（按 `mcp__server__tool` 前缀聚合同一 MCP 服务）\n\n**工具分组**区是结构化编辑器：每个分组有标识符、名称、说明、工具勾选（只能从当前目录里的真实工具中选）和说明节绑定，支持增删；留空则每个工具各自成为条目。`sectionTools` 仍留在 schema 里（进阶用法：说明节到工具名的依赖映射），但不再出现在表单中。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"配置"}
{"unit_id":"hairyf__dsh-tool-activator#readme-11","repo":"hairyf/dsh-tool-activator","commit":"6c7e609b732faec318e9dd44d16b52d531ea0098","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-activator README · 状态、审批与生命周期：* **执行路由**：通过 DSH 原有 dispatcher 执行，不改变底层沙箱或运行路由。\n* **持久化与恢复**：已完成的激活状态随标准会话日志和 seed 恢复，不依赖中途内存状态。\n* **生命周期**：Cordis 负责注册、监听及 HMR 清理，卸载时自动清理样式与实例。\n\n---\n\n* **测试情况**：2026-10-11 完全权限修复后，12 个文件、304 个用例全部通过；lint、类型检查与 Build 同样通过。\n* **未验证项**：真实 GUI E2E、打包发布及真实 profile 验证。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"状态、审批与生命周期"}
